### Get all product types (default: active, page 1, limit 10)
GET http://{{BE_URL}}/product-types

###

### Get product types with pagination
GET http://{{BE_URL}}/product-types?page=1&limit=5

###

### Get product types by category
GET http://{{BE_URL}}/product-types?category_id=1

###

### Search product types by name
GET http://{{BE_URL}}/product-types?product_type_name_vn=Áo

###

### Get all product types (including inactive)
GET http://{{BE_URL}}/product-types?status=all

###

### Get inactive product types only
GET http://{{BE_URL}}/product-types?status=inactive

###

### Get product types sorted by name ascending
GET http://{{BE_URL}}/product-types?sort_by=product_type_name_vn&sort_order=ASC

###

### Get product types with multiple filters
GET http://{{BE_URL}}/product-types?category_id=1&status=active&page=1&limit=10&sort_by=created_at&sort_order=DESC

###

### POST - Create new product type (with image)
POST http://{{BE_URL}}/product-types
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=----WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW

------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="categoryId"

1
------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="productTypeNameVn"

Áo thun nam
------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="descriptionVn"

Áo thun nam cotton cao cấp
------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="status"

active
------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="productTypeImage"; filename="producttype.jpg"
Content-Type: image/jpeg

< ./path/to/your/image.jpg
------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW--

###

### POST - Create new product type (without image, using camelCase - auto converted)
POST http://{{BE_URL}}/product-types
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=----WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW

------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="categoryId"

2
------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="productTypeNameVn"

Quần jean
------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="descriptionVn"

Quần jean thời trang
------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="status"

active
------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW--

###

### PUT - Update product type (all fields with new image)
PUT http://{{BE_URL}}/product-types/1
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=----WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW

------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="categoryId"

1
------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="productTypeNameVn"

Ghế Sofa Cao Cấp
------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="descriptionVn"

Mô tả mới cho loại sản phẩm ghế sofa cao cấp
------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="status"

active
------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="productTypeImage"; filename="sofa-new.jpg"
Content-Type: image/jpeg

< ./path/to/your/new-image.jpg
------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW--

